    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t01-practice-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "思维精练 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t01-practice-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25国考）运送一批货物，第一趟派出10辆大车，第二趟又增派15辆小车，运输量比第一趟高50%。问每辆大车的载货量是小车的多少倍？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "3"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "2.5"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "2"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "1.5"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          21
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          15
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s02-t01-practice-01-p021.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（二） · 思维精练1 · 讲义第15页",
            "pdfPage": 21
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t01-practice-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s02-t01-practice-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看第二趟“又增派15辆小车”，原来的10辆大车仍在运。设一辆小车每趟运1份，大车运x份；第一趟10x，新增的15份正好是第一趟的50%。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "15=10x\\times50\\%\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x=3"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以大车载货量是小车的3倍，选A。我们没有把第二趟误读成只有15辆小车。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "增加的车辆承担的是增加的运输量，先比较增量最省事。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
