        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t01-practice-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "思维精练 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t01-practice-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26四川）一位顾客购买1件A商品和3件B商品，结账时错误地按3件A商品和1件B商品的价格进行计算，总价是实际总价的0.8倍。问A商品的单价是B商品的（）。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "不到0.7倍"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "0.7~1.0倍之间"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "1.0~1.4倍之间"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "1.4倍以上"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          21
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          15
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s02-t01-practice-02-p021.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（二） · 思维精练2 · 讲义第15页",
            "pdfPage": 21
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t01-practice-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s02-t01-practice-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先设B商品单价为1份，A商品为x份。实际应付x+3，错误结账为3x+1，后者是前者的0.8倍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "3x+1=0.8(x+3)\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad2.2x=1.4\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x=\\frac7{11}\\approx0.636"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "不到0.7倍，所以选A。核验错误金额为32/11，实际金额为40/11，二者比值确实是0.8。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "只有价格倍数关系、求单价比时，可把其中一种单价设为1。"
        }
      ],
